**/ios/**/DerivedData/
**/ios/**/Pods/
**/ios/**/xcuserdata/
**/ios/**/*.mode1v3
**/ios/**/*.mode2v3
**/ios/**/*.moved-aside
**/ios/**/*.pbxuser
**/ios/**/*.perspectivev3
**/ios/**/*sync/
